      "assets/models/characters/{heads,hair,tops,bottoms,shoes}/ — remaster meshes per slot",
      "assets/ui/previews/ — creator thumbnails from these sheets",
      "content/appearance_presets.json — load presets.json vectors"
    ],
    "everwind_notes": [
      "Body = skinned MeshInstance3D modules on shared Skeleton3D",
      "Face = high-res painted albedo OR optional Sprite3D billboard for talk/emote",
      "Keep silhouette readable at ~64–96px on screen (phone)",
      "Tint via ShaderMaterial albedo_tint for hair/cloth colors (vector color indices)",
      "Do not bake gender into meshes — swap MAN/WOMAN part packs like Java RES_MANPARTS/WOMANPARTS"
    ]
